Abstract = {The urbanization of the areas has brought benefits that have allowed
   economic growth and improvements in the quality of life of people, but
   has also paid for the environmental part. Green roofs are a technology
   that contributes to sustainable development. For this reason, the
   present work discloses relevant information about the origin,
   characteristics and benefits of green roofs, as well as a compilation of
   academic activities of different organisms being carried out in favor of
   this green technology and, finally, successful cases in Mexico. A series
   of environmental benefits are reported, such as the reduction of
   pollution and temperature of the environment, social benefits such as
   the reduction of diseases and mortality percentages in the population
   and economic benefits such as savings due to the reduction of energy
   consumption.},
