Abstract = {This work shows how a doctoral thesis project, aimed at studying
   teachers' thinking on human nutrition, approaches to environmental
   problems, through initial and in-service teacher education for the
   primary education level. The article justifies the environmental
   dimension of human nutrition, serving as a reference for decisions made
   in the proposed methodology. It also presents some initial findings that
   though still limited, show that teachers' environmental sensibility in
   teacher education in relation to the topic of human nutrition, is below
   desired levels.},
